# the screen reader (fm1-reader, announce.c): BERLIN by name, the main screen (the chord, the scale), a page and a
# knob said once they settle, a button's message
wait 200
listen
wait 300
said Berlin page: Filter Off, Evolve 55, Motion 30, Drift 64 bars. Piece
listen
where
said Scale F, G, Ab, Bb, C, D, Eb
tap SAVE
wait 300
said Atmosphere page, character Wind
turn ALGO 2
wait 300
said Space
tap REC
wait 300
said HOLD
